## Regresión: `to string` sobre un string no debe doble-liberar (0.21.1).
weave main into int:
    var a as string is "42" to string
    if not (a == "42"):
        return 1
    var b as string is ("42" to string) + "x"
    if not (b == "42x"):
        return 1
    var n as int is 42
    var c as string is n to string
    if not (c == "42"):
        return 1
    return 0
